window.products.push({"id":868005,"name":"Hozzen Portable Mini Air Pump for Inflatables - 1600mAh Type-C Rechargeable, 6 Nozzles Electric Air Pump with LED Light, Quick Inflate/Deflate for Air","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vdpvRsvyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌀SAFE & QUICK IN/DEFLATION🌀 - This electric air pump is designed with a powerful motor, offering 3.5kPa/0.5psi pressure and 200L/Min airflow, ensuring rapid inflation/deflation in minutes (depending on product sizes). No more time wasting! A built-in thermal sensor will automatically shut off the air pump to avoid overheating. 🌀6 NOZZLES & DIVERSE USE🌀 - Come with 6 nozzles, this backpacking air pump is suitable for most inflatable products. Let's say, air mattress, air bed, air sofa, air pillow, swimming ring, pool float, inflatable toy, foil decorative balloon, vacuum storage bag, and the list goes on. (Tips: This mini air pump is not suitable for balloons, tires, basketball, surfboard, yoga-ball and such.) 🌀1600MAH & TYPE-C CHARGING🌀 - This portable air pump is equipped with a 1600mAh battery, which lasts over 20min continuous work with one full charge. With a convenient type-c cable, you can recharge the air pump from a power bank, laptop and more. The charging indicators will remind you when it’s fully charged. 🌀CAMPING LIGHT MODE🌀 - This camping air pump is also a portable light source that offers 3 lighting choices. The rechargeable air compressor lasts up to 10 hours under the 40-lumen mode, 6 hours for 160-lumen and 3 hours for 400-lumen. With a hook design, you can hang it on the tent easily. 🌀MINI SIZE & LIGHTWEIGHT🌀 - Designed with a 5.2*4.7*6.3cm / 2*1.8*2.5inch mini body, this quick fill air pump can be attached to your backpack with its hook or put in your pocket. Also, it weights only 100g/3.5oz, convenient to take with or store, it’s the top choice for outdoor camping and home use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vdpvRsvyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hozzen","source_asin":"B0BZCXYNPQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-868005","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZCXYNPQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZCXYNPQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
