window.products.push({"id":868008,"name":"Moksha Automatic Magnetic Stirring Cup, Self-Stirring Mug Battery-Free Hot Water Insulation, Self-Mixing Cup, Ideal Mixing Mug for Office, Home, Trave","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Jr6+OzW9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fully automatic magnetic stirring: a new generation of stirring cup, which is more advanced and magical than the traditional one. It does not need to be energized and is driven by heat. When the water temperature reaches 70 degrees Celsius, the rotor will automatically rotate, and the water temperature will stop when it drops to 55 degrees Celsius. The higher the temperature The faster it turns. Three high-quality materials: two-layer high-quality 304 stainless steel body, food-grade plastic handle and silicone sealing cover. The safety of the cup is increased, and the durability of the cup is also ensured. Humanized design: a new generation of exquisite design is added, the handle is easier to hold, the bottom is made of non-slip PVC material, which is more suitable for hot drinks, the lid has a non-slip function, and it also adds high air tightness and strengthens the side prevention It has the function of cooling and heat preservation. When the water exceeds 98 degrees Celsius, the rotor rotates, and the water can be controlled between 50-60 within three minutes and maintained for a long time. The method of use is simple: it is easy to operate. You only need to put the rotor in the middle of the cup, add the materials and boiling water, and close the lid. You only need to wait for a few minutes, and your hot drink is finished. Easy to carry: The lightweight design is easy to put into the backpack, and the capacity of 350ML is more in line with the personal carrying ability, and it is also easy to control the concentration of the drink. Specially designed for coffee, tea, beverages, etc., suitable for home, work, travel, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Jr6+OzW9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moksha","source_asin":"B08GZTW1NX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-868008","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GZTW1NX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GZTW1NX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
