window.products.push({"id":868060,"name":"AVLA 2 Pack Grid Storage Baskets with Hooks, Wire Over Cabinet Door Hanging Organizer, Metal Wall Grid Basket Holder Rack, Steel Stackable Kitchen Sin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KMi9r4PZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You will get 2 packs of grid storage baskets with hooks measured 9.3\"L x 4.5\"W x 12.5\"H ( including the hooks ). Fits over interior cabinet doors up to 0.78\" thick. Please measure in advance the purchase. Durable Construction: AVLA Wire Over Cabinet Door Hanging Organizer is made of sturdy iron wire with coating outside, durable and not easily to rust. The sturdy metal brackets and towel rack allow a variety of items without bending or buckling. Save More Space: Metal wall-mounted fruit basket adds extra storage space for you to organize your pantry, kitchen, bathroom, office, closet, or RVs. These wall hanging baskets can support various items, such as fruits, snacks, vegetables, spice jars, shampoos, bath bombs, sponges or personal care items. Unique Appearance: Our Steel Stackable Kitchen Sink Organization Bin with its special diamond line shape will be a great decor for your house. The storage bins complement your home with its distinctive style. It will also be an ideal gift for your friends and family who love organization. No hardware or drilling is required, you don't need to assemble them, just hang them over the cabinets door or under your sink, save space for a crowded room. The metal grid storage baskets come with foam padded hooks to slide easily over cabinet door without scratches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KMi9r4PZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AVLA","source_asin":"B0B3SY5MMP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-868060","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3SY5MMP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3SY5MMP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":868061,"name":"Home Soft Things Serenta Velvet Quilted 5 Piece Bed Spread Set, Diamond Design Soft Lightweight reversible Quilt Coverlet Bedspread Bedding Set for Al","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-AN3VcPCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"INSTANT MAKE-OVER! Super Soft Flannel Microfiber Velvet 5-Piece bedspread sets are designed for comfort, warmth, and class. The highly detailed diamond pattern quilting provides an elegant ambiance to your bedroom. Snuggle up in the velvety softness with your sweetheart and find the ultimate slumber. Light-weight and durable for year-around use. PICK YOUR COLOR! With plenty of solid color options we’re sure there’s one that fits beautifully with your existing decor. A set includes 1 – Oversized Bedspread 122 inches x 106 inches, 2 - Shams 20 inches x 26 inches and 2 -Shams 20 inches x 36 inches. Each piece of the set features a straight edge all the way around for a sleek style. LOVELY GIFTING! These wonderful sets make a classy, thoughtful gift for loved ones. Birthdays, anniversaries, weddings, bridal showers, Christmas, whatever the occasion, it’s the gift from the heart that matters most. Sets are skillfully folded and tucked into a rectangular polybag with a full-color product card. Send a sweet, personalized message with your order, upon request. SERENTA GOODNESS! 100% polyester with reinforced diamond stitching to help the filling resist against sliding and separating. Each piece of the set features ultra-soft flannel microfiber velvet on top and smooth polyester on the bottom. Serenta products are crafted with the highest quality materials, exquisite attention to details, and uniquely knitted fabrics for the affordable luxury you deserve. CARE MATTERS! With Serenta you get a no fuss washing and caring experience. Simply machine wash, separately, using cold water on a gentle cycle. Tumble dry on lowest heat setting to avoid heat damage to your set. By following the proper care instructions, you can expect your Serenta product to endure a lifetime of love and use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-AN3VcPCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Soft Things","source_asin":"B07MJ7T8CF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-868061","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MJ7T8CF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MJ7T8CF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
