window.products.push({"id":868089,"name":"Kitchener Meat Mixer Stainless Steel Manual Hand Crank 4.2 Gallon/16L Max 17.6LBS Pound Capacity Heavy Duty Commercial Food Grade w/ 4 Removable Mixin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WgBUvYGTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Kitchener Manual Meat Mixer is constructed of Food Grade Safe Stainless Steel (inside & out) Tub & Paddles that are durable & Rust Resistant. Included are sturdy gripping foot pads, a see-through cover lid & 4 Mixing Paddles. Tub size measures 11\" (L) x 8 3/4\" (W) x 11\" (H) & an overall light weight of 15LBS. Mixing meat by hand takes a lot of time & energy. Now the meat mixing process easier than ever! This Manual Meat Mixer has an Extra Large 4.2 Gallon Mixing Tub/Bin Capable of mixing 13.2-17.6 LBS (pounds) of meat at one time. The 4 Mixing Paddles ensure thorough mixing to SPICE UP food by simply making sausage, jerky or your desired ground meat SEASONED & JUICY (by adding a little water), during the mixing process utilizing the slot design on the Acrylic/’Plexiglas’ Lid. Kitchener gives you the confidence to make your favorite tasting meat! When using the Meat Mixer use both hands with firm grip while operating the turn handle. Always wash this Meat Mixer by hand before storing, the Mixing Paddles, Turn Handle & Tub are removable for easy clean-up. DO NOT wash in a dishwasher, our Meat Mixers are not dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WgBUvYGTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitchener","source_asin":"B06Y4G258G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-868089","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y4G258G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y4G258G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
