window.products.push({"id":868248,"name":"winorax Personalized Sister Gifts From Sisters Brother Friends I'd Walk Through Fire For You Tumbler 20oz 30oz Insulated Tumblers Coffee Travel Mug Wi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PhxYDDZBL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Everyone knows that siblings are the best kind of friends! There's no one you can share secrets with like your sibling. Share an extra special bond with this custom tumbler for two people who want to keep it all in the family, together. When she's feeling down, she'll be sure to perk up when seeing how uniquely obsessed with each other you two are. A personalized tumbler with a cute design is absolutely enough for a meaningful gift. Whenever she drinks coffee, water, or her favorite beverage, looks at the tumbler, you are the one that she will think about. One of the ideal sister gifts from sister or brother for special occasions like Mother's Day, Birthday, Graduation, Wedding, Thanksgiving, Bridal Shower, Moving Away, or just because. Available in 2 sizes: 20oz and 30oz, which fit in most cup holders. With 20oz or 30oz capacity, our insulated, stainless steel, double-wall tumbler was designed to keep your beverages hot or cold for many hours. Moreover, our tumblers come with BPA-free, convenient drink lid. Constructed of 18/8 food-grade stainless steel, WinoRax tumblers are durable, unbreakable, sweat proof, rust resistant. How to Customize: Please complete fields required to customize options (Name/Characteristics/Photo) and recheck carefully all the customized options. The last step, click \"Preview\" to get a glimpse of the wonderful creation you’ve made. Please be aware that the Preview may slightly different from the physical item in terms of color due to our lighting at our product photoshoot or your device’s display. Care Instruction: Hand Wash Recommended NOT dishwasher or microwave safe Do not drop Our tumblers are made with love, so please handle with care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PhxYDDZBL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"winorax","source_asin":"B09XTR2R1M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-868248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XTR2R1M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XTR2R1M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
