window.products.push({"id":868250,"name":"Wusthof Grand Prix II 7 Piece Knife Block Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZWbW+W7kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Grand Prix II Seven-Piece Block Set by Wusthof features the four most versatile knives that no kitchen should be without, along with the accessories needed to keep them safe and well cared for. Combined with a pair of pull-apart kitchen shears, these tools are a great start for any home or professional kitchen. Each knife in the Grand Prix II series by Wusthof-Trident is forged from a single piece of specialy tempered high carbon stainless steel to ensure outstanding strength. The result of the patented Wusthof process is extraordinary, easy to maintain sharpness. The handles of these full-tang knifes are ergonomic, and are seamless, making them extremely hygenic. Each knife in the Grand Prix II series is perfectly balanced, ensuring effortless cutting. These knives are bold and contemporary while offering outstanding performance. The Wusthof Grand Prix II 8\" Cook's Knife is a true kitchen multi-tasker. No kitchen is complete without at least one of these manually-operated food processors. The chef's, or cook's knife is the most essential of all knives used in the kitchen. For coarse or fine chopping, mincing or dicing of virtually any kind of food. Perfectly balanced, the cook's knife is an extension of your hand. The Wusthof Grand Prix II 8\" Bread Knife is designed to cut even the freshest, crustiest loaves of bread with ease. This knife goes beyond bread however, it is useful for cutting cakes, a crusty roast, or even tough skinned fruits and vegetables. The Wusthof Grand Prix II 4.5\" Utility Knife is the most versatile of all paring knives. This knife is perfect for for mincing shallots, onions and herbs as well as cleaning and cutting vegetables The Wusthof Grand Prix II 3.5\" Paring Knife is ideal for precise cuts. The short, straight blade makes it perfect for mincing as well as cleaning and cutting fruits and vegetables. The Wust hof 8\" Kitchen Shears are a welcome helper in any kitchen. These shears are well-suited for a multitude of tasks from","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZWbW+W7kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wüsthof","source_asin":"B000PJXRRY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-868250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000PJXRRY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000PJXRRY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":868251,"name":"Magnetic Measuring Spoons Set of 9, Stackable Magnetic Nesting Measuring Spoon Set, Stainless Steel Dual Sided for Measuring Dry and Liquid Ingredient","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CoFzuQbnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Magnetic measuring spoon 9-piece set, double-sided for liquid and dry double-sided design, easy to separate dry and liquid components during measurement, oval and round heads are perfect for most containers. These magnetic measuring spoons allow each spoon to be sucked and held together so that it can be stored compactly in a drawer, cabinet or cabinet without being messy. It also cuts high-precision and easy-to-read teaspoons/tablespoons and milliliter measurements, no guesswork when adding ingredients, and the stainless steel polished surface makes it easy to clean when needed. Colour: Black Tips Do not place the spoon in a microwave, oven, or other heat source.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CoFzuQbnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MYSENLAN","source_asin":"B09BC78RY5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-868251","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BC78RY5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BC78RY5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
