window.products.push({"id":868273,"name":"Wusthof Silverpoint 9-Piece Steak Block Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41W4KX6YFCL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description With the same slip-resistant fiberglass/nylon handles as Grand Prix knives but with stamped rather than forged stainless-steel blades, Silver Point knives offer a less-expensive complement to Wüsthof's premium lines. The stamping process means the knives don't have bolsters, but they're still manufactured from the same high-carbon stainless steel as Grand Prix, though with thinner blades. Each of the eight steak knives measures 4-1/2 inches long, an ideal length for slicing cuts of beef, pork, or turkey at the dinner table. They also feature balanced handles that facilitate smoother cutting, along with laser-tested edges for precision. The knives, which come with a wooden storage block, are dishwasher-safe, though Wüsthof recommends hand washing for a longer life. The set also carries a lifetime warranty against defects. What's in the Box Eight steak knives and hardwood storage block Amazon.com Textured for grip and fitted with high-carbon stainless steel blades, these Wusthof Silverpoint steak knives are a good starter set for the steak and chop lover. The knives have an easy weight and maneuverable tip, and their straight blades cut cleanly through T-bones and pork loin. The blades are stamped-instead of forged, as higher quality knives are-with laser-tested sharpness and a 4-1/2-inch length. The Silverpoint line is fashioned from the same material as Wusthof's Grand Prix knives, but with thinner blades and no bolsters. Eight in all, the set stores in a tidy upright hardwood storage block. Wusthof recommends washing the knives by hand, but they can be run through the dishwasher in a pinch. Though not exactly an heirloom purchase or a match for your fine china, these knives perform well on casual occasions and carry a lifetime warranty. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41W4KX6YFCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wüsthof","source_asin":"B0000DYKM8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-868273","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000DYKM8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000DYKM8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
