window.products.push({"id":868567,"name":"boba straw reusable stainless steel drinking metal straws final portable case with cleaner container set and lids rubber tips stainless-steel pack of ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tgahVOEmL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"It's time to find an environmentally-friendly alternative to plastic drinking straws. Our oceans are currently filling up with plastic waste at an alarming rate. A chunk of this waste is from plastic straws and latest estimates state that over 63 BILLION of them are thrown away daily worldwide.  Luckily there are now more alternatives to these single use beverage straws like paper, glass, and stainless steel. However, Paper straws disintegrate and glass is not kid or travel-friendly. Help save the environment by using The CupBoard Premium Stainless Steel Metal Drinking Straws - the perfect substitute to plastic straws. These straws are reusable, making them more eco-friendly than plastic straws, which are thrown away after just one use. They are also safer for our bodies since we don't have to deal with the chemicals found in plastics leaching out into our beverages and into our lips/mouth.  They also come with silicon tips to protect teeth and lips from overly hot or cold drinks as well as 2 cleaning brushes and a handy carrying case and pouch so that you can bring it with you to use wherever you are.  Here are more benefits when using our stainless steel straws:  ✅ Its sleek finish looks elegant and will even match your fine table cutlery at home.  ✅ Taste the way your drinks are supposed to taste; no more plastic \"flavored\" beverages with these stainless straws.  ✅ No need to cut back on your favorite Boba milk tea drink because you also get a bigger stainless \"Boba\" straw with a 12mm diameter and a matching carrying case for it.  ✅ Enjoy a straw that is strong enough to push into an orange so you can enjoy orange juice directly from it. Do your small, but makes a MAJOR IMPACT, bit in saving the environment by using The CupBoard’s Premium Stainless Steel Metal Drinking Straws. Click \"Add to Cart\" TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tgahVOEmL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Cupboard LLC","source_asin":"B07FZH87RN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-868567","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FZH87RN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FZH87RN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
