window.products.push({"id":868575,"name":"The Farmers Market HOME SWEET HOME Wood Top Cookie Tins, Cake Canisters, Set of 2, Natural, Rustic Style, Chrome and Ribbed Details, Galvanized, 8 1/4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R4LSBwjPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DID SOMEONE SAY COOKIES? Our Farmers market HOME SWEET HOME CAKE Tins, Set of 2, are embellished with a sweet silver medallion and designed to keep your baked treats stored away from humidity longer. This fun set features snug fitting grainy wooden tops that score style points for their warm natural color. PRACTICAL AND STURDY, these pieces are crafted of white galvanized metal. The wooden tops open to reveal a smooth white shiny interior. GREAT SIZES Well sized, this set of 2 cake tins measures as follows: 1- 7 1/2 D x 4 T and 2- 8 1/4 D x 4 3/4 T inches. KEEP IT FRESH With their chic wooden tops and sweet silver medallions, these white containers are ready to hold your fresh baked goods while adding welcoming vibes with farmhouse style. AN IDEAL GIFT, it's perfect to celebrate holidays, birthdays, weddings and many more. So gorgeous, you'll want to keep it at home for yourself. Enjoy! By Whole House Worlds Welcome to the product line of Whole House Worlds. The New York based company offers high quality, stylish products for every room in the house, and beyond. From the kitchen, to the living room, to the bedroom, dining room, home office, closet and garden: Our criteria are comfort, quality, style and value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R4LSBwjPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WHW Whole House Worlds","source_asin":"B0752WS5LF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-868575","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0752WS5LF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0752WS5LF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":868576,"name":"Golden Retriever Dog Souvenir Magnet 2\"x 3\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CG94tkelL._AC_.jpg","description":"Here's a brand new, rare and a hard to find collector's item: Golden Retriever Dog Souvenir Magnet 2\"x 3\". These magnets are made of industrial strength vinyl and are neither flexible nor bendable. They are also water resistant but not waterproof and it's not advisable to keep them in water for prolonged periods of time. These magnets are standard and not 3D (tri-dimensional). Please note : these magnets MAY NOT stick to stainless steel appliances. So please check in advance whether or not the surface you are planning to use is \"magnet friendly\". These are all extremely rare and would make a wonderful addition to anyone's collection or make a perfect gift!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CG94tkelL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Souvenir Destiny","source_asin":"B00UBKSK6U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-868576","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00UBKSK6U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00UBKSK6U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":868577,"name":"Natural Wicker Woven Storage Basket with Liner, Decorative Baskets and Bathroom Organizer for Living Room, Bathroom, Closet Organizer and Bath Beauty ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YExQge2DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Natural Wicker Woven Storage Baskets for the Style-Forward Bathroom, Kitchen or Pure Home Decor? A great wicker shelf storage basket with handles for simple carrying and rustic decor. It's perfect for organising your bathroom, living room or adding a style to your storage shelves. With a lovely finish, this woven basket is awfully presentable, and is certainly one to help bring a banal corner to life. This is the rustic storage and home organising solution while maintaining a chic appeal (and we all know this handcrafted basket bins looks much better than a ratty, oddly patterned box of store-bought tissues) These hand woven wicker storage baskets made of natural seagrass and water hyacinth promote a healthy world. It is environmentally friendly from every angle. These materials do not leave an excess of negative impacts due to harvesting and transportation. When compared with plastics, natural wicker basket bins are far more ecological sound Your favorite woven storage basket provides innumerable functions. Whether it be by way of pure decor, little chic organising basket, closet basket for bathroom shelves, or small under shelf wire basket, your options eclipse any confines you may have imagined. Why Made Terra Woven Basket? Our collection of seagrass and water hyacinth wicker baskets gives a whole new meaning to \"statement piece.\" By purchasing a maker-to-market product, you knowingly support Vietnam Artisan Communities and help preserving Indigenous Crafts & Cultures Whether you're in it for the style or the statement, you're still making a difference with your very own dollar. Go easy on the planet. Opt for the eco-friendly yet classy Woven Wicker Storage Baskets, Decorative Baskets and Bathroom Organizer for Living Room, Bathroom, Closet Organizer by Made Terra! Click to add to your cart NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YExQge2DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MadeTerra","source_asin":"B081526K2G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-868577","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081526K2G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081526K2G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":868578,"name":"Wine Opener Set - Best Lever-Action Opener, Foil Cutter, Extra Corkscrew in Gift Box plus 2 Free Wine Pour Discs: Luxury Copper/Bronze Finish - Removi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ItWk1pWFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Opening a bottle of wine is as easy as 1, 2, 3, 4: Pull lever all the way down until it stops; Pull lever all the way down until it stops; Gripping the handles around neck, pull lever all the way over inserting the spiral into the cork; Gripping the handles around neck, pull lever all the way over inserting the spiral into the cork; Now pull lever all the way down again, thus removing the cork; Now pull lever all the way down again, thus removing the cork; Repeat steps 2 & 3 and the cork will magically pop out into your hands. Repeat steps 2 & 3 and the cork will magically pop out into your hands. There are 2 secrets to this incredibly easy to use corkscrew: Archimedes taught us the secret advantage of the mechanical lever. Archimedes taught us the secret advantage of the mechanical lever. The secret of teflon which coats the spiral corkscrew. The secret of teflon which coats the spiral corkscrew. Let's Have A Party – Can you Imagine this? It’s noon – You finally finished cleaning and setting up for your wine-tasting party – The food is prepared – The dishes, glasses, silverware all put out. Nothing left but to set out the drinks and open the wine bottles ... whoa, wait a minute ... you’ve got a lot of wine bottles to open and ... HOLY SMOKE ! ... The guests will all be here in an hour! Not to worry ... you have a Trader Dave's Wine Bottle Opener ... You’ll be done in less than 10 minutes. In time for a final look around and to relax before the fun begins! So – Let's get to work and LET THE PARTY BEGIN! Even if you're just opening one bottle at a time, the Trader Dave's Wine Bottle Opener will soon be your BFF – Easy to use and easy to store. They make excellent gifts, too!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ItWk1pWFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trader Dave's Bottle Wine Opener Set","source_asin":"B077J6WBR7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-868578","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077J6WBR7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077J6WBR7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
