window.products.push({"id":868645,"name":"4 Pcs Thick Clear Placemats Wipe Clean Plastic Placemats Set of 4 Placemat for Kitchen Dinner Table Place Mats Dining Placemats Plastic Waterproof, Wi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aZvhtf-ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ If there is any problem, pls feel free to contact us for a solution before leaving comments. To avoid the water marks, pls clean the mat with half-dry towel rather than the wet.  The new item's smell will go away after 1-2 days. There will be no air bubbles , when you separate the clear mats from each other.] Easy Wipe Clean Clear Festival Family Party Placemats set of 4 1. Big Enough & Room Saving The table mats size is about 17.7*11.8 inch. Wonderful clear placemats for dining table to protect your brand new luxurious kitchen tables. Multi-pieces water proof parties placemats are sturdy, but a single placemat is soft and easy to roll up for storing than cloth placemats or a traditional textile placemat. 2. Crumbs & Water Resistant Placemats For non-woven placemats, the steam from hot plates will not have a chance to go through table mats and leave moisture or stickiness underneath. So you don't have to wipe down the table after every use. Besides, this kind of placemats and coasters are easier to clean for the flat surface. You know the fabric mats may have a lot of tiny holes where the food crumbs, water and oils will be stuck in. 3. Multipurpose Placemats, Coasters with 3 years QUALITY GUARANTEE for the wear resistant As a traditional table placemat, parties accessories snacks place mats, cabinet glasses mat, or refrigerator shelve mats are also ok. Kitchen cabinets mat can stop water and dust from bowls, plates and other kitchenware at the same time protecting the case. Placing under often moving objects in the kitchen can avoid desktop scratches. Perfect for kids who spill their food very often. 4. Christmas Party Placemats Thick Enough, Waterproof, No crumbs stuck in, No liquids/oils leak thru, Easy clean, Bright color wipeable placemat for multipurpose use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aZvhtf-ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"August Dream","source_asin":"B07QXQKPGJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-868645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QXQKPGJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QXQKPGJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
