window.products.push({"id":868752,"name":"It's Ok I'm on 500mg of Fukitol 11oz Funny Coffee Mug Inspirational Sarcasm Desk Office Decor For Women Men Sister Brother Friend Coworker By CBT Mugs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QmxvbfTZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lasting Quality: High-quality, smooth ceramic stoneware resists scratches and lasts a long time. The custom imprint is permanent and won’t lose its luster or fade. Your stoneware ceramic mug can be used with either hand since the It's Okay I'm On 500 mg Of Fukitol design is printed on two sides. Good for Any Occasion; with an 11-ounce capacity, these mugs hold plenty of liquid and make great gifts for all of your special occasions: anniversaries, bachelor and bachelorette parties, and birthday Safe for the Microwave and Dishwasher: Use your mug again and again in the microwave. Wash it in the dishwasher after every use and still never worry about the design fading away or peeling over time. Cold and hot temperatures will not affect the high quality of your ceramic stoneware mug, so you’ll feel confident to use it every day. Though simple, this cute cat mug makes a thoughtful gift for anyone on their birthday, Christmas, Hanukkah, Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, or any special occasion. Fun Way to Break the Ice: Your new ceramic coffee cup displays It's Okay I'm On 500 mg Of Fukitol on both sides so you can both laugh over your coffee or tea in the morning. The double-sided design makes an ideal gift for a new bride and groom or a wonderful housewarming present. Surprise your spouse with this cute, thoughtful gift for your anniversary or any time you want to show you care. Carefully Packed, Satisfaction Is Guaranteed: 100% customer satisfaction is our goal. To make sure each ceramic mug arrives at its new home safe and sound. Our durable new packaging delivers the high-quality mugs to you reliably. If you ever find a craftsmanship or materials defect in any of our mugs, simply contact our friendly and responsive customer service folks. We stand behind all of our carefully crafted and packed products and will work with you to find a solution that’s pleasing to you Your Language Is Sarcasm: Tell everybody what you really think and do it with a healthy dose of humor. Let the world share in the happiness of your good mornings with a hot or cold drink of your favorite beverage from this humorous mug. Or save it for afternoon time and enjoy your favorite beer, rum, tequila, wine, or whatever your favorite might be.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QmxvbfTZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CBTwear","source_asin":"B08CWQ63R5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-868752","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CWQ63R5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CWQ63R5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
