window.products.push({"id":868928,"name":"Sleepwish Cute Fox Bedding Coverlets Boho Modern Pattern Bed Set Woodland Animal Duvet Cover Watercolor Comforter Cover Sets (Neon Purple, Queen)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f0RtuzplL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"IMPORTANT NOTE: NO STUFFING INSIDE the duvet cover(not include any comforter or filling) you can put your own comforter, duvet or blanket into the cover, just COVER. Twin size: 1 Duvet Cover (68\" x86\") and 2 Pillowcase (20\" x 26\"). No Comforter in Set.Full size: 1 Duvet Cover (80\" x 90\") and 2 Pillowcases (20\" x 26\"). No Comforter in Set.Queen size: 1 Duvet Cover (90\" x 90\") and 2 Pillowcases (20\" x 36\"). No Comforter in Set.king size: 1 Duvet Cover (104\" x 90\") and 2 Pillowcases (20\" x 36\"). No Comforter in Set.DUVET COVER: A duvet cover is a protective layer that slips over the duvet and has a closure. Because duvets and comforters can be expensive and difficult to clean, duvet covers are useful because they protect your comforter during use and are easily removed and easy to wash.You can also quickly and easily change the look of your bed and room without having to completely redecorate.The duvet cover also allows you to change your style or color of your bedding with the simple switch of the cover.HOW TO USE THE DUVET COVER: 1) Lay the comforter flat. 2) Insert your hands inside and find the two top corners. holding one corner in each hand. 3) With your hands inside the duvet cover, reach down to grab hold of the comforter’s top two corners. 4) Holding the top two corners tightly, give it a shake and a fluff until the duvet cover falls down to cover most of the comforter. 5) Stuff the bottom two corners of the comforter inside the bottom two corners of the duvet cover. zip it up at last!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f0RtuzplL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sleepwish","source_asin":"B08F1YKMH2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-868928","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F1YKMH2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F1YKMH2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":868929,"name":"Combination 6 Russian CUT Crystal Drinking Tea Glasses W/metal Glass Holders \"Podstakannik\" for Hot or Cold Liquids","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sPirC8EtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hand made beautiful cut crystal glasses from the republic of Belarus. An old Russian tradition of tea drinking during a long train ride required being able to hold a glass filled with hot tea. These glasses fit a metal glass holder \"podstakannik\" or they can be used by themselves. A beautiful design on the glass is sure to decorate your dinner table. The holders \"podstakannik\" are designed in the old tradition and are dishwasher safe. The glasses fit the holders perfectly as they were designed as a set.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sPirC8EtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Belarus","source_asin":"B009I383MW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-868929","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009I383MW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009I383MW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
